{"id":"8e8b0cfdbdfd70aa","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-thm-ideal-density.md","title":"Ideal Density Theorem","display":"thm-ideal-density — Ideal Density Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-ideal-density","aliases":["58-thm-ideal-density"],"display":"thm-ideal-density — Ideal Density Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-J]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-ideal-density"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-ideal-density</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ideal-density — Ideal Density Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8763ccf377783f45\" href=\"?note=8763ccf377783f45\" title=\"58-df-J\">58-df-J</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}_S(I,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}_S(I,\\kappa)\\)</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 上的真理想（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8763ccf377783f45\" href=\"?note=8763ccf377783f45\" title=\"58-df-J\">58-df-J</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[B]_I\\leq[A]_I\\leftrightarrow B\\setminus A\\in I\">\\([B]_I\\leq[A]_I\\leftrightarrow B\\setminus A\\in I\\)</span> 为商代数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\kappa)/I\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\kappa)/I\\)</span> 的序</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IdealQuotientDensityAtMost}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{IdealQuotientDensityAtMost}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> 是本文件定义的有界密度谓词</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}density\\text{-}at\\text{-}most}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IdealQuotientDensityAtMost}_S(I,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ideal}_S(I,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\n\\exists D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\setminus I\\;\\Bigl(\n|D|\\leq\\lambda\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\setminus I\\;\\exists B\\in D\\;(B\\setminus A\\in I)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}density\\text{-}at\\text{-}most}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IdealQuotientDensityAtMost}_S(I,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ideal}_S(I,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\n\\exists D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\setminus I\\;\\Bigl(\n|D|\\leq\\lambda\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\setminus I\\;\\exists B\\in D\\;(B\\setminus A\\in I)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ideal-density}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ideal}_S(I,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\Bigr)\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{IdealQuotientDensityAtMost}_S(I,\\kappa,\\lambda)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\setminus I\\;\\bigl(\n|D|\\leq\\lambda\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\setminus I\\;\\exists B\\in D\\;(B\\setminus A\\in I)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ideal-density}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ideal}_S(I,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\Bigr)\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{IdealQuotientDensityAtMost}_S(I,\\kappa,\\lambda)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\setminus I\\;\\bigl(\n|D|\\leq\\lambda\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\setminus I\\;\\exists B\\in D\\;(B\\setminus A\\in I)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这刻画的是商布尔代数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\kappa)/I\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\kappa)/I\\)</span> 的稠密度：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 中某个正集在模 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 意义下位于每个正集之下。</li>\n<li>旧断言量化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\subseteq I\">\\(\\mathcal A\\subseteq I\\)</span>，但理想的向下闭性已自动给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\setminus X\\in I\">\\(Y\\setminus X\\in I\\)</span>，所以不能刻画任何非平凡密度性质。</li>\n<li>未注册的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dens}\">\\(\\operatorname{dens}\\)</span> 项已由三元关系取代；关系直接量化商序的正集代表元，因此不依赖未选定的商集编码。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-J","status":"resolved","id":"8763ccf377783f45","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-J]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-J","status":"resolved","id":"8763ccf377783f45","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ideal}_S(I,\\kappa)$，即 $I$ 为 $\\kappa$ 上的真理想（see [[58-df-J]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)$（see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}_S(I,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"[B]_I\\leq[A]_I\\leftrightarrow B\\setminus A\\in I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\kappa)/I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IdealQuotientDensityAtMost}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}density\\text{-}at\\text{-}most}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IdealQuotientDensityAtMost}_S(I,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ideal}_S(I,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\n\\exists D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\setminus I\\;\\Bigl(\n|D|\\leq\\lambda\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\setminus I\\;\\exists B\\in D\\;(B\\setminus A\\in I)\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ideal-density}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ideal}_S(I,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\Bigr)\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{IdealQuotientDensityAtMost}_S(I,\\kappa,\\lambda)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\setminus I\\;\\bigl(\n|D|\\leq\\lambda\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\setminus I\\;\\exists B\\in D\\;(B\\setminus A\\in I)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\kappa)/I","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\subseteq I","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\setminus X\\in I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dens}","display":false}],"bytes":1916,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4217","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-thm-ideal-density.md|58-thm-ideal-density]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["8763ccf377783f45","5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}